            <font style="letter-spacing:-0.2pt;">EXPLANATORY NOTE</font><font style="font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font>
          </div>


          <div style="text-indent:20pt; margin-top:8pt; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;font-size:10pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">This revised preliminary proxy statement (the &#8220;Revised Preliminary Proxy Statement&#8221;) amends the preliminary proxy statement and preliminary proxy card of Digital Brands Group, Inc. filed with the Securities and Exchange Commission on June&#160;28, 2023. The Revised Preliminary Proxy Statement is being filed to amend the Special Meeting date, update descriptions of the Series&#160;B Preferred Stock, and add certain risk factor disclosures associated to Proposal No.1.</font>
          </div>

      </div>
      <div style="margin-top:2.00000000000002pt;margin-bottom:35.86pt;margin-left:69.66pt;width:456pt;">
        <div style="margin-top:5pt; text-align:center; width:456pt; line-height:12pt;font-family:Times New Roman, Times, serif ;font-size:10pt;">
