          <div style=" margin-top:2.91pt; margin-bottom:0pt; line-height:12pt; text-align:left; margin-left:20pt;">
            <font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">Consists of 6,300 shares of Series&#160;A Convertible Preferred Stock at a $9.3051 conversion price. The issuance of shares of Common Stock upon conversion of the Series&#160;A Convertible Preferred Stock is subject to a limit of 19.99% of the issued and outstanding Common Stock and the reporting person has agreed not to convert in any calendar month more than the greater of $500,000 or 10% of the aggregate trading volume of Common Stock as reported by Nasdaq. The shares of Series&#160;A Convertible Preferred Stock are owned of record by Boco4-DSTLD-Senior Debt, LLC. Kurt Hanson is the manager of Boco4-DSTLD-Senior Debt,</font><font style=" white-space:pre; text-decoration:underline #0081C4 solid;color:#0081C4;letter-spacing:0.2pt;"> </font><font style="letter-spacing:0.2pt;">LLC and as such may be deemed to have sole voting and investment discretion with respect to shares of Series&#160;A Convertible Preferred Stock held by Boco4-DSTLD-Senior Debt, LLC. Mr.&#160;Hanson disclaims any beneficial ownership of the securities held by Boco4-DSTLD-Senior Debt, LLC other than to the extent of any pecuniary interest he may have therein, directly or indirectly. The address of Boco4-DSTLD-Senior Debt, LLC is 111 S Main Street, Suite 2025, Salt Lake City, UT 84111. </font>
          </div>
